:121","surah":20,"ayah":121,"ar_uthmani":"فَأَكَلَا مِنْهَا فَبَدَتْ لَهُمَا سَوْءَٰتُهُمَا وَطَفِقَا يَخْصِفَانِ عَلَيْهِمَا مِن وَرَقِ ٱلْجَنَّةِ ۚ وَعَصَىٰٓ ءَادَمُ رَبَّهُۥ فَغَوَىٰ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and they both ate from it. They became conscious of their nakedness and began to cover themselves with leaves from the garden. Adam disobeyed his Lord and was led astray-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَأَكَلَا","en_gloss":"Then they both ate","transliteration":"fa-akalā","verse_key":"20:121"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مِنْهَا","en_gloss":"from it","transliteration":"min'hā","verse_key":"20:121"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فَبَدَتْ","en_gloss":"so became apparent","transliteration":"fabadat","verse_key":"20:121"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَهُمَا","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"lahumā","verse_key":"20:121"},{"pos":5,"ar":"سَوْءَٰتُهُمَا","en_gloss":"their shame","transliteration":"sawātuhumā","verse_key":"20:121"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَطَفِقَا","en_gloss":"and they began","transliteration":"waṭafiqā","verse_key":"20:121"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يَخْصِفَانِ","en_gloss":"(to) fasten","transliteration":"yakhṣifāni","verse_key":"20:121"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمَا","en_gloss":"on themselves","transliteration":"ʿalayhimā","verse_key":"20:121"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"20:121"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَرَقِ","en_gloss":"(the) leaves","transliteration":"waraqi","verse_key":"20:121"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْجَنَّةِ ۚ","en_gloss":"(of) Paradise","transliteration":"l-janati","verse_key":"20:121"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَعَصَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"And Adam disobeyed","transliteration":"waʿaṣā","verse_key":"20:121"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ءَادَمُ","en_gloss":"And Adam disobeyed","transliteration":"ādamu","verse_key":"20:121"},{"pos":14,"ar":"رَبَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"his Lord","transliteration":"rabbahu","verse_key":"20:121"},{"pos":15,"ar":"فَغَوَىٰ","en_gloss":"and erred","transliteration":"faghawā","verse_key":"20:121"},{"pos":16,"ar":"١٢١","en_gloss":"(121)","transliteration":"","verse_key